:"`68-141`"},"3159":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-55","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#key-files","content":"The `companion object` containing the `load` logic and parsing helpers."},"3160":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-56","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#behaviour-that-does-surprise","content":"The `load` function in `BooblikConfig.kt` will throw an error if a file path is provided but the file does not exist, whereas it is perfectly fine to load with no file at all (`BooblikConfig.kt:82-85`)."},"3161":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-57","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#behaviour-that-does-surprise","content":"The `SegmentMode.MAPPED` value is the default, but the configuration allows for other modes via the `enum` helper (`BooblikConfig.kt:122-126`)."},"3162":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-58","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#behaviour-that-does-surprise","content":"The `BooblikConfig` class uses an `init` block to perform secondary validation on values like `port` and `segmentCapacity` after they have been parsed (`BooblikConfig.kt:49-55`)."},"3163":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app","type":"page","content":"booblik-app","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Wiki","booblik-app"],"tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-app"},"3164":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app-0","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-app#what-this-module-is-responsible-for","content":"What this module is responsible for"},"3165":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app-1","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-app#diagram","content":"Diagram"},"3166":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-