ion handling"},"3977":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance-55","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-conformance#behaviour-that-surprises","content":"When using `AckPolicy.NONE`, the `BooblikClient.sendProduce` function returns `null`, and the client must return immediately without reading to avoid blocking forever `Main.kt:124-126`."},"3978":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance-56","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-conformance#behaviour-that-surprises","content":"A `fetch` response that contains an empty list of records but has the `truncated` flag set is not a sign of having caught up to the head, but rather an indication that the next record exceeds `maxBytes` `Main.kt:182-184`."},"3979":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client","type":"page","content":"The conformance client contract","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Wiki","booblik-conformance"],"tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client"},"3980":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client-0","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client#diagram","content":"Diagram"},"3981":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client-1","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client#the-cli-verb-interface","content":"The CLI Verb Interface"},"3982":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client-2","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client#the-capabilities-declaration","content":"The `capabilities` Declaration"},"3983":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-client-3","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-conformance/the-conformance-clien