,"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol/ackpolicy#behaviour-that-surprising","content":"A `FORCED` policy in a group will trigger a single `log.force()` for all members of that group, meaning the latency of the barrier is shared across all producers in that batch (`PartitionWriter.kt:37-43`)."},"4239":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"page","content":"booblik-protocol","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Wiki","booblik-protocol"],"tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol"},"4240":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol-0","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol#what-this-module-is-responsible-for","content":"What this module is responsible for"},"4241":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol-1","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol#diagram","content":"Diagram"},"4242":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol-2","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol#protocol-constants-and-versioning","content":"Protocol Constants and Versioning"},"4243":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol-3","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol#requestencoder","content":"RequestEncoder"},"4244":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol-4","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol#ackpolicy","content":"AckPolicy"},"4245":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol-5","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol#partitioner","content":"Partitioner"},"4246":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol-6","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol#offset-topicname-and-partitionid","content":"Offset, TopicName, and PartitionId"},"4247":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol-7","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-protocol","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-protocol#key-files","content":"Key files"},"4248"