t-Booblik.Conformance-35","page_id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance#behaviour-that-surprise","content":"In `ProduceKeyed`, the client performs the partitioning logic itself using `topic.PartitionFor(key)` because the broker does not receive the key `Program.cs:141-152`."},"4976":{"id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance-36","page_id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance#behaviour-that-surprise","content":"When `Fetch` encounters a truncated record due to size limits, it reports `recordExceedsMaxBytes` instead of simply returning an empty list `Program.cs:85-89`."},"4977":{"id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval","page_id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval","type":"page","content":"Metadata Retrieval","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Wiki","clients/dotnet/Booblik.Conformance"],"tags":[],"url":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval"},"4978":{"id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval-0","page_id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval#diagram","content":"Diagram"},"4979":{"id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval-1","page_id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval#metadatarequest","content":"MetadataRequest"},"4980":{"id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval-2","page_id":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/clients-dotnet-Booblik.Conformance/metadata-retrieval#topicmetadata-and-partitionmetadata","content":"TopicMetadata and PartitionMetadata"},"4981":{"id":"/wiki/clients-dotne