:"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"The module provides six client libraries, five of which are reimplementations of the protocol and one which is a multiplatform target (`README.md:21`). All six libraries are designed to act as both producer and consumer, and all six must pass the same fourteen conformance checks (`README.md:6-7`)."},"5627":{"id":"/wiki/clients-13","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"Language"},"5628":{"id":"/wiki/clients-14","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"Coordinate"},"5629":{"id":"/wiki/clients-15","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"Roles"},"5630":{"id":"/wiki/clients-16","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"Dependencies"},"5631":{"id":"/wiki/clients-17","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"Go"},"5632":{"id":"/wiki/clients-18","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"`github.com/youndie/booblik/clients/go`"},"5633":{"id":"/wiki/clients-19","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"producer, consumer"},"5634":{"id":"/wiki/clients-20","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"none"},"5635":{"id":"/wiki/clients-21","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"Python"},"5636":{"id":"/wiki/clients-22","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/clients#client-implementations","content":"`booblik` on PyPI"},"5637":{"id":"/wiki/clients-23","page_id":"/wiki/clients","tags":[],"ty